card: "Rotate by Custom Degrees\n\nPages turned by any angle as vector content — text stays selectable, nothing is rasterised.\n\nYOUR FILE\n\ncolour.pdf\n\n5.2 KB · 8 pages\n\nREADY\n✕\n+\nUse another file\nIt stays on this device\n▾\nFEWER OPTIONS\nROTATION\nANGLE\n2°\n\nPositive turns clockwise. A 90°, 180° or 270° turn is cheaper and lossless on the Rotate tool, which stores it; any other angle re-lays the page as vector content.\n\nPAGE SIZE\nGrow the page so nothing is cut\nKeep the original page size (may crop corners)\n\nAn angle that is not a right angle turns the corners outside the original sheet.\n\nPAGES\nall\nnone\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n8 OF 8 SELECTED\n\nLeave as \"all\", or use 1,3,5-7, odd, even. A page outside this document is named before the run, never quietly skipped.\n\nHONEST NOTES (3)\n▸\n\nTurn"
